#====================================================================
# DRAFT-librecast-0.11.2-conan2-package-info-manual-transitive-include-propagation.kv
# Conan 2 生产者侧 package_info 手动聚合传递依赖 include/lib 路径
# 完整叙事与证据见同目录 .md
#====================================================================

id:                     DRAFT (proposed E-numbered，最终编号由知识库主编确认)
trigger_tool:           conan|cmake|conan_test
phase:                  package|testing
error_signature:        fatal error: 'lcrq.h' file not found|lcrq_INCLUDE_DIRS_RELEASE \)
severity:               2
category:               conan, cmake, packaging, c-libraries
match_keywords:         conan, CMakeDeps, transitive dependency, include dirs, autotools, package_info, aggregated_components, test_package, find_package, requires, INTERFACE_INCLUDE_DIRECTORIES, empty include, producer-side, manual propagation
title:                  Conan 2 CMakeDeps 对纯 autotools 传递依赖（无 CMake target 导出）生成空 include dirs，即使 producer package_info 设了 requires 且 consumer 直接 find_package 也不修复，必须由 producer 在 package_info 中手动聚合 dependencies 的 includedirs/libdirs/libs
root_cause:             Conan 2.29.1 CMakeDeps 对非 CMake 导出型依赖（纯 autotools 库）的传递依赖，即使 producer 声明了 cpp_info.requires 且 consumer 直接 find_package，生成的 xxx_INCLUDE_DIRS_RELEASE 仍为空。原因是 lcrq 不导出任何 .cmake target 文件，CMakeDeps 无法从包中恢复 include 路径；而 lcrq package_info 中的 includedirs 设置在作为传递依赖时不被序列化到 consumer 侧 data.cmake。修复方式：producer package_info 中遍历 self.dependencies.values()，对已知传递依赖调用 dep.cpp_info.aggregated_components() 并将 includedirs/libdirs/libs 追加到自身 cpp_info
affected_scope:         Conan 2 纯 C autotools 库：公共头 #include 第三方 autotools 库头文件（如 librecast/types.h -> lcrq.h），第三方库无 CMake target 导出，走 CMakeDeps 消费链；test_package 用 find_package(A) + target_link_libraries(A::A)
verification_cmd:       conan create archives/l/librecast/0.11.2 -pr:h=ohos-device -pr:b=ohos-device -s build_type=Release；修复前 test_package 编译 fatal error: 'lcrq.h' file not found，且 lcrq-release-armv8-data.cmake 中 lcrq_INCLUDE_DIRS_RELEASE 为空；修复后编译链接通过
rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           producer-package-info-manual-aggregate-transitive-deps
rec_description:        producer package_info 中遍历 self.dependencies.values()，对公共头传递 include 的依赖调用 dep.cpp_info.aggregated_components()，将 includedirs/libdirs/libs 追加到自身 cpp_info。这是纯 autotools 传递依赖的标准修复模式，与消费者侧显式 requires（DRAFT-conan2-cmakedeps-transitive-include-strip）互补——后者适用于有 CMake target 的依赖（如 boost），前者适用于无 CMake target 的纯 autotools 依赖（如 lcrq）
rec_command:            def package_info(self):\n    self.cpp_info.libs = ["librecast"]\n    for dep in self.dependencies.values():\n        if dep.ref.name in ("libsodium", "lcrq"):\n            comp = dep.cpp_info.aggregated_components()\n            for d in comp.includedirs: self.cpp_info.includedirs.append(d)\n            for d in comp.libdirs: self.cpp_info.libdirs.append(d)\n            for lib in comp.libs: self.cpp_info.libs.append(lib)
rec_auto_fix:           false
rec_impl:               manual-conan-recipe
forbid_1_pattern:       cp_path|CPATH.*lcrq|CMAKE_INCLUDE_PATH.*lcrq
forbid_1_reason:        环境变量兜底能骗过编译器但破坏 Conan 依赖图的声明式语义
forbid_1_consequence:   本地通过但干净 CI 复现失败；下游消费者重复踩坑
forbid_2_pattern:       copy.*lcrq\.h.*include/
forbid_2_reason:        把传递依赖头文件复制进自身包——制品膨胀且版本漂移
forbid_2_consequence:   下游拿到错误版本的 lcrq.h，与实际链接的 liblcrq.so ABI 不匹配
principles:
causes:                 []
caused_by:              []
similar_to:             [DRAFT-conan2-cmakedeps-transitive-include-strip, DRAFT-conan-shared-pkgconfig-requires-drop]
conflicts_with:         []
prerequisite_of:        []
